    <item>
      <title>顶级律师事务所如何从奋起反抗特朗普到屈膝</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/us/politics/paul-weiss-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[保罗·韦斯几十年来一直是进步派的坚定支持者，并在他的第一个任期内领导了对特朗普总统的法律抵抗。然后不战而降。这就是它转型的内幕。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/us/politics/paul-weiss-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 12:31:39 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>美国恢复向联合国儿童基金会、全球疫苗免疫联盟和世界粮食计划署提供部分疫苗和卫生援助</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/health/trump-health-aid-state-department.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这笔金额仍远低于美国之前在人道主义和卫生援助方面的支出，但恢复了用于抗击营养不良和疾病的关键努力的资金流动。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/health/trump-health-aid-state-department.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 11:49:32 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普、保罗·韦斯和大法的投降：5 个要点</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/us/politics/trump-paul-weiss-takeaways.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[保罗韦斯律师事务所领导了对特朗普总统的法律抵抗。然后它导致了整个法律行业的突然撤退。 《纽约时报》的一项调查调查了它是如何屈服于白宫压力的。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/02/us/politics/trump-paul-weiss-takeaways.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 09:01:05 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在掉落反光池案例中，皮罗引起了特朗普的愤怒</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/jeanine-pirro-trump-reflecting-pool.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[华盛顿美国检察官珍妮·皮罗 (Jeanine Pirro) 将其归咎于劣质建筑，这与特朗普总统钟爱的理论相矛盾。特朗普先生表示他“100%”不同意她的观点。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/jeanine-pirro-trump-reflecting-pool.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:49:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>米奇·麦康奈尔仍在住院，错过了肯塔基州签名政治野餐</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/mitch-mcconnell-kentucky-republicans.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[参议员米奇·麦康奈尔的持续住院意味着他错过了在任期间参加肯塔基州西部标志性活动的最后机会。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/mitch-mcconnell-kentucky-republicans.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 22:59:45 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗在其代理人的帮助下策划了更广泛的战争</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/iran-proxies-war-oil.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在短暂的休战期间，伊朗人秘密制定了一项计划，如果美军再次发动攻击，将增加特朗普总统的战争成本。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/iran-proxies-war-oil.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:26:35 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普呼吁为布兰奇总检察长之争提供18亿美元资金</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-todd-blanche-weaponization-payouts.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统发誓，如果参议院共和党人未能确认托德·布兰奇担任司法部长，从而重新引发有关和解的争议，他将推动支付基金。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-todd-blanche-weaponization-payouts.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 20:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>以色列称在黎巴嫩关键山顶杀死了几名真主党成员</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/world/middleeast/israel-hezbollah-lebanon-killing.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[这场在黎巴嫩南部战略山脊上发生的对抗对以色列和伊朗支持的激进组织之间脆弱的停火构成了挑战。]]></description>
