    <item>
      <title>特朗普的民意调查数字创下新低。不要指望他会改变路线。</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-polls-approval-rating.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[仅有三分之一的美国人认可特朗普的处理方式，这使他在任期的现阶段处于第二任期总统的历史深渊。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/01/us/politics/trump-polls-approval-rating.html</guid>
